chx:X_PinnedInstallFails a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:PinnedInstallFails ; rdfs:label "pip install openai-whisper==20231117"@en ; skos:definition "Appendix A pins openai-whisper 20231117, whose only file on PyPI is a source archive; pip download of it ended with return code 1 and the error ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'pkg_resources' on Python 3.12.3, and it installed only after setuptools below 81 was installed and the build isolation was switched off, giving 20231117."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
