chx:X_VttListing a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:VttListing ; rdfs:label "get_writer('vtt', '.')(result, 'audio')"@en ; skos:definition "The WebVTT writer wrote 215 bytes that begin with WEBVTT, use a full stop before the milliseconds, leave the hours out under an hour (00:00.000 --> 00:05.640) and carry no block numbers; the file equals the chapter's listing 8 (True)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
