chx:X_YtDlpPackage a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:YtDlpPackage ; rdfs:label "pip install yt-dlp"@en ; skos:definition "yt-dlp 2026.8.19 (requires Python >=3.10) is the newest release on PyPI that is not a development build; PyPI lists 641 releases of it, 124 of them in the stable numbering, and its newest upload is the development build 2026.10.10.233141.dev0, which pip does not take unless asked."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
