chx:X_InfoDictionary a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:InfoDictionary ; rdfs:label "info = ydl.extract_info(video_url)"@en ; skos:definition "For the video of the chapter, extract_info returned a dictionary of 76 keys with the title 'Beyond the Basic Stuff with Python - Al Sweigart - Part 1', a duration of 565 seconds and 16 formats, and metadata.json written from it had 557422 bytes, with no video downloaded."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
