chx:X_WindowsSapi5 a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:WindowsSapi5 ; rdfs:label "pyttsx3.init('sapi5')  # Windows"@en ; skos:definition "On Windows pyttsx3 uses the SAPI 5 driver sapi5.py; the study read its source (200) and Microsoft's page on SAPI 5.4 (200), but no Windows machine was available, so the driver, the voices David and Zira that the chapter lists and the speed of listing 4 were NOT EXECUTED."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
