chx:X_NotExecutedList a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:NotExecutedList ; rdfs:label "NOT EXECUTED"@en ; skos:definition "The reasons for what could not be run are facts of the machine: /dev/snd exists False, nvidia-smi is installed False, torch.cuda.is_available() is False, the system is Linux and the memory is 8029 MiB; so nothing was heard, no GPU or large model was used, and Windows, macOS, cloud engines that need keys and downloads from YouTube were NOT EXECUTED."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
