chx:X_SingleRunLabels a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:SingleRunLabels ; rdfs:label "SINGLE RUN"@en ; skos:definition "Each record of the study carries its date and the label of a single run: the models record (2026-10-14), the corpus record (2026-10-14), the interpreter record (2026-10-14) and the live record (2026-10-14) were all observed on 2026-10-14, and none of their timings was repeated, so a timing is one measurement on two cores."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch24/research> .
